# [[Turkey]] (country)
[[Category:de:Countries of Europe]]
[[Category:de:Countries of Asia]]

====Usage notes====

Unlike most German names of countries (which are usually neutral), Türkei is feminine and takes the definite article ''[[die]]''. Die Türkei befindet sich beide in Asien und Europa. - Turkey is to be found in both Asia and Europe. Viele Bewohner Deutschlands stammen aus der Türkei. - Lots of Germany's citizens are from Turkey.

